    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD STRONG TEAM OF FARMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy farmers and items for them to equip. Always make the most of the resources you have and seek for better combinations of characters and their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/cb3adcd4376aca7d1078ecaf4f34a3a5.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=640 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/cb3adcd4376aca7d1078ecaf4f34a3a5.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/cb3adcd4376aca7d1078ecaf4f34a3a5.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATIC BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you continue your journey, you will be forced to face enemies in automatic battle. Hope you prepare well.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/a78e6fee28d06f6cacc68600f7a9bd4f.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/a78e6fee28d06f6cacc68600f7a9bd4f.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/a78e6fee28d06f6cacc68600f7a9bd4f.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECOVER FALLEN FARMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the battle, you will need to decide whether to spend the valuable mushrooms on recovering farmers who fell in battle or save it to upgrade your team later.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/d20b7059c329ef689ebc1cec4d86e0f0.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/d20b7059c329ef689ebc1cec4d86e0f0.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/d20b7059c329ef689ebc1cec4d86e0f0.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOST POWERFUL ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of ways to get loot in this game. But to get the most powerful items you must look for secrets, use unobvious strategies and truly think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/7dee957bc24c92ca09b7b2cc5aff4d0b.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/7dee957bc24c92ca09b7b2cc5aff4d0b.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/7dee957bc24c92ca09b7b2cc5aff4d0b.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD STRONG TEAM OF FARMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy farmers and items for them to equip. Always make the most of the resources you have and seek for better combinations of characters and their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/cb3adcd4376aca7d1078ecaf4f34a3a5.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=640 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/cb3adcd4376aca7d1078ecaf4f34a3a5.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/cb3adcd4376aca7d1078ecaf4f34a3a5.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATIC BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you continue your journey, you will be forced to face enemies in automatic battle. Hope you prepare well.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/a78e6fee28d06f6cacc68600f7a9bd4f.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/a78e6fee28d06f6cacc68600f7a9bd4f.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/a78e6fee28d06f6cacc68600f7a9bd4f.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECOVER FALLEN FARMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the battle, you will need to decide whether to spend the valuable mushrooms on recovering farmers who fell in battle or save it to upgrade your team later.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/d20b7059c329ef689ebc1cec4d86e0f0.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/d20b7059c329ef689ebc1cec4d86e0f0.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/d20b7059c329ef689ebc1cec4d86e0f0.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOST POWERFUL ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of ways to get loot in this game. But to get the most powerful items you must look for secrets, use unobvious strategies and truly think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/7dee957bc24c92ca09b7b2cc5aff4d0b.poster.avif?t=1740559939\" width=600 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/7dee957bc24c92ca09b7b2cc5aff4d0b.webm?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/7dee957bc24c92ca09b7b2cc5aff4d0b.mp4?t=1740559939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
